---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: How to Apply
description: The enrollment procedure at Westside Baptist Academy — application, records, testing, interview and orientation.
permalink: /admissions/apply/
---

{# Wording comes from src/_data/apply.json so it can be edited in the CMS. #}

<div class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="section__eyebrow">Admissions</span>
    <h1>How to Apply</h1>
    <p class="page-head__lede">{{ apply.lede }}</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="prose">

      <ol class="steps">
        {% for step in apply.steps %}
        <li>
          <h3>{{ step.heading }}</h3>
          {{ step.text | markdown | safe }}
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>

      {% for section in apply.sections %}
      <h2>{{ section.heading }}</h2>
      {{ section.body | markdown | safe }}
      {% endfor %}

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Call <a href="tel:{{ site.contact.phoneHref }}">{{ site.contact.phone }}</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">{{ site.contact.email }}</a>.</p>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Ready to start?</h2>
    <p>A tour is the right first step. It costs you an hour and tells you more than any brochure.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn--light" href="/admissions/visit/">Schedule a Tour</a>
      <a class="btn btn--light" href="/families/forms/">Download Forms</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
